class: positive
summary: [0480]/[1870] a union of several atoms and one pointer is one structural identity whatever its written order, repeated members or aliases, and flattens an atom set, a one-atom union and another such union as members, while its pointer permission stays part of it
constructs: 0440, 0480, 0640, 1795, 1870
program: program.ldn
targets: linux-x86-64, macos-arm64
